# UI design

- Feel: Apple / Linear / Stripe / Framer — luxury, not generic Bootstrap.
- Stack: Tailwind + `@mysimcha/ui` (shadcn-style primitives). No one-off ugly defaults.
- Mobile first. Keyboard and screen-reader accessible. Visible `:focus-visible`.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Brand tokens come from `@mysimcha/branding`, not hardcoded hex in pages.
- Framer Motion later; do not add motion that ignores reduced-motion.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button style={{ background: "blue" }}>Save</button>

// ✅ GOOD
import { Button } from "@mysimcha/ui";
<Button type="submit">Save</Button>
```
